# agent-workbench.env -- OPTIONAL data-root overrides for the CLI. No
# secrets live here. Copy, edit, then `. agent-workbench.env`, or export
# the vars yourself.

# bd (beads) board hub. FUNCTIONAL: read directly by the `bd` Python code,
# honored everywhere.
BEADS_HUB_DIR=$HOME/.beads-hub

# Knowledgebase vault and artifact root.
#
# NOT a functional override once the containers are running. The compose
# services bind their host paths at container start, so setting these does
# NOT move where the CONTAINERIZED knowledgebase / artifact review services
# read and write. They only affect the bare-host code paths that read the
# env var directly. To actually relocate the containerized data roots, edit
# the volume lines in docker-compose.yml. See
# docs/agent-workbench-hardening-plan.md (H3).
KB_HOME=$HOME/.knowledgebase
ARTIFACTS_HOME=$HOME/.local/share/artifacts

# kb-svc's LLM-enrichment secrets are NOT here -- see
# scripts/kb-container/kb.env.example and copy it to $KB_HOME/kb.env.
